# BATTLEZONE X — ULTIMATE AAA 3D ONLINE MULTIPLAYER BATTLE ROYALE

## COMPLETE MASTER PROMPT — ANDROID + REAL ONLINE MULTIPLAYER + BACKEND + APK

Act as a complete professional game development studio consisting of senior game programmers, 3D environment artists, multiplayer network engineers, backend developers, UI/UX designers, Android build engineers, security engineers and QA testers.

Your mission is to design, implement, test and package an original, realistic 3D online multiplayer battle royale game named **BATTLEZONE X**.

The game should deliver the excitement of modern mobile battle royale games while maintaining its own original identity, gameplay, art style, map design, weapons, characters, UI and branding.

Do not copy proprietary assets, source code, maps, logos, characters or distinctive UI designs from existing commercial games.

The result must be a genuinely playable game, not a static design, clickable mockup, single-player simulation falsely labeled multiplayer, or a collection of incomplete scripts.

